      "created_at": "2024-02-13T17:35:19.652Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I believe starting with the very first Letters Page episode and going all the way to the Disparation Backerkit update, when introducing Iron Legacy, the first timeline that is discussed is one where Legacy is killed by Baron Blade. But this of course is not the Iron Legacy timeline, so I’m confused by the purpose of this story in relation to Iron Legacy. Why is this specific story mentioned before the story of Iron Legacy?</p>",
